window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-029-1aeca906ad19670d.json"]={sha256:"1aeca906ad19670dd75264ff875df343a6738a7ad4f070dd455af85e8c722fc5",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-bd763f41f0267698","url":"https://www.keycloak.org/docs/latest/authorization_services/index.html","title":"Keycloak Authorization Services Guide","titleEn":"Keycloak Authorization Services Guide","publisher":"Keycloak","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-029","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-029","related":[{"id":"security-v27-030","referenceUrls":["https://ranger.apache.org/blogs/policy_model.html"],"title":"Apache Ranger：標籤分類、資源匹配與例外審查","titleEn":"Apache Ranger: tag classification, resource matching and exception review","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：50%與66.667%由共同通過列導出，單側正面及未授權scope都拒絕。 交付uma-permissions.csv、逐scope判定表與兩層策略清單；所有token只用不可驗證的合成payload描述。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Derive 50 and approximately 66.667 percent from joint-positive rows and reject one-sided positives and unauthorized scopes. Deliver uma-permissions.csv, per-scope decisions and the two-level strategy inventory. Tokens are represented only by inert synthetic payload descriptors, with no reusable credentials.","difference":"建立十個資料資源，列路徑、PII標籤、讀取角色及核准例外；先定義本課只允許合規角色讀取PII，其他標籤不受這條規則影響。","differenceEn":"Build ten resources with paths, PII tags, reader roles and approved exceptions. Define the local rule before testing: only the selected compliant role may read PII; resources without that tag remain subject to other policies rather than this one rule.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課指定兩政策皆正面才授權；計數必須取逐列交集，不能把兩政策各自允許數相加。實際部署還需核對permission層與聚合policy各自策略。 12筆中角色政策通過9筆，所有權通過8筆，兩者共同通過6筆；資料表明列共同與單側通過者。 Unanimous通過率6/12×100=50%；補正兩筆已有角色資格者的所有權資料後，交集變8，比例66.667%。","本課計算應標PII且已正確標記的覆蓋率；缺標是分類缺口，不代表資源本來不敏感。所有例外需獨立理由及到期，不能由通過率倒推核准。 十個資源中8個經人工真值表判為PII，目前只有6個標記正確；另2個非PII保持未標記。 覆蓋率6/8×100=75%；補上一個漏標PII資源後為7/8×100=87.5%，仍有一個分類缺口。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["The exercise requires both policies to evaluate positively. Count the row-level intersection rather than adding independent allow totals. A deployment must also verify strategy settings at the permission and aggregated-policy levels, which are distinct configuration locations. Among 12 requests the role policy passes nine, ownership passes eight and six pass both. List joint and one-sided outcomes explicitly so the intersection is inspectable and not inferred from marginal totals alone. Unanimous admission is 6/12×100=50 percent. Correcting ownership for two already role-qualified requests increases the intersection to eight, or approximately 66.667 percent, without changing the request population.","Measure correctly tagged resources among those that should be classified PII. Missing tags are classification gaps, not proof of nonsensitivity. Exceptions require separate justification and expiry and cannot be authorized by a favorable aggregate pass rate. The independent ground-truth table identifies eight of ten resources as PII, but only six are correctly tagged. Two genuinely non-PII resources remain untagged; they must not be mixed into the PII-coverage denominator. Coverage is 6/8×100=75 percent. Correcting one missed PII tag yields 7/8×100=87.5 percent, still leaving one classification gap; a higher number does not establish complete protection.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-039","referenceUrls":["https://github.com/opencontainers/image-spec/blob/main/image-index.md"],"title":"OCI映像索引：平台描述與不可變主體鏈","titleEn":"OCI image indexes: platform descriptors and immutable subject chains","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：50%與66.667%由共同通過列導出，單側正面及未授權scope都拒絕。 交付uma-permissions.csv、逐scope判定表與兩層策略清單；所有token只用不可驗證的合成payload描述。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Derive 50 and approximately 66.667 percent from joint-positive rows and reject one-sided positives and unauthorized scopes. Deliver uma-permissions.csv, per-scope decisions and the two-level strategy inventory. Tokens are represented only by inert synthetic payload descriptors, with no reusable credentials.","difference":"建立10個部署描述，列要求OS、architecture、variant、索引摘要與實際選中manifest；另列未知平台與重複匹配順序反例。","differenceEn":"Build ten deployment descriptors with required OS, architecture, variant, index digest and selected manifest. Include unsupported platforms and multiple matching entries, retaining their order rather than treating the index as an unordered dictionary.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課指定兩政策皆正面才授權；計數必須取逐列交集，不能把兩政策各自允許數相加。實際部署還需核對permission層與聚合policy各自策略。 12筆中角色政策通過9筆，所有權通過8筆，兩者共同通過6筆；資料表明列共同與單側通過者。 Unanimous通過率6/12×100=50%；補正兩筆已有角色資格者的所有權資料後，交集變8，比例66.667%。","本地准入要求平台契約符合且選中manifest摘要在已審查集合；tag只做顯示，不當穩定識別。索引摘要與子摘要各有不同範圍，不能互相代換。 10筆中8筆平台選擇正確，其中6筆子manifest摘要已核准；2筆平台錯誤即使摘要已知仍不通過。 完整准入率6/10×100=60%；為一筆正確平台補齊子manifest審查後變7/10×100=70%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["The exercise requires both policies to evaluate positively. Count the row-level intersection rather than adding independent allow totals. A deployment must also verify strategy settings at the permission and aggregated-policy levels, which are distinct configuration locations. Among 12 requests the role policy passes nine, ownership passes eight and six pass both. List joint and one-sided outcomes explicitly so the intersection is inspectable and not inferred from marginal totals alone. Unanimous admission is 6/12×100=50 percent. Correcting ownership for two already role-qualified requests increases the intersection to eight, or approximately 66.667 percent, without changing the request population.","The local gate requires platform compatibility and a selected manifest digest in the reviewed set. Tags remain display labels. Index and child-manifest digests identify different objects and cannot be substituted for one another in verification. Eight of ten deployments select the intended platform, and six of those use an approved child digest. Two platform-mismatched deployments remain rejected even if their digest appears elsewhere in an approved inventory. Full admission is 6/10×100=60 percent. Completing child-manifest review for one correctly selected platform yields 7/10×100=70 percent without changing the requested platform or the other descriptors.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-349badf7c407fe2b","url":"https://ranger.apache.org/blogs/policy_model.html","title":"Apache Ranger policy model","titleEn":"Apache Ranger policy model","publisher":"Apache Ranger","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-742b345320e0ef0d","url":"https://github.com/opencontainers/image-spec/blob/main/image-index.md","title":"OCI Image Index specification","titleEn":"OCI Image Index specification","publisher":"Open Container Initiative","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
